# Pairs with GateOwnership. Even an inline nested link that lands must hand the gate back before the split returns.
MODULE: NestedLinkLeaksGate
TARGET: GateOwnership
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a split whose nested capture linked inline returns without releasing its split gate
PERTURBS: ForegroundNestedDone

--- FIND
    /\ fg = "nested"
    /\ ~NestedCaptureDefersLink
--- REPLACE
    /\ fg = "nested"
    \* MUTATION: the nested capture links inline
    /\ TRUE
--- END
--- FIND
    /\ fg = "awaitNest"
    /\ ch["nest"] \in {"done", "deferred"}
    /\ fg' = "release"
--- REPLACE
    /\ fg = "awaitNest"
    /\ ch["nest"] \in {"done", "deferred"}
    \* MUTATION: the split returns holding its gate
    /\ fg' = "done"
--- END
